@awilkinson @RoamResearch @andy_matuschak Follow-up: I feel FOMO when I use hierarchical notes to explore ideas. Oh no! I'm now in one of the 64 leafs of this subtree! What am I missing!

With Roam: only the pleasure of exploring, and no pressure of anywhere to be or what I'm missing. @Conaw

Roam's my fav thesis break.

@awilkinson @RoamResearch Graph-based structure for notes. After a few hours of developing my own flow, it turned research from laborious into a fun game.

When bored, I often open Roam and start exploring my brain and what I'm learning.

Knowledge accretion, as @andy_matuschak would say

@sumdp You should write more poems
But other problems await
Oh no, climate change
